                <pb facs="0712" n="702" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv03/pg702"/>

                <head>Appendix “A”</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Draft Resolution in Regard to the
                        Reduction of Forces and Armaments</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">For Presentation to the Peace Conference</p>
                <p>That a Commission be appointed with two representatives apiece from each of the
                    five Great Powers, and five representatives to be elected by the other Powers
                    represented at the Conference:— <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>to advise on an immediate and drastic reduction in the armed forces of
                            the enemy;</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>to prepare a plan in connection with the League of Nations for a
                            permanent reduction in the burden of military, naval and aerial forces
                            and armaments.</item>
                    </list></p>
            </div>
